{"4007640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Signal Station", "steam_appid": 4007640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007640/extras/bc604a4e41ceae73c6de6ba352a81fde.poster.avif?t=1769673384\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007640/extras/bc604a4e41ceae73c6de6ba352a81fde.webm?t=1769673384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007640/extras/bc604a4e41ceae73c6de6ba352a81fde.mp4?t=1769673384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You are Operator_07. Decode an impossible signal. Decide humanity's fate.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1984. Remote listening station. An anomalous pattern appears in the cosmic noise structured, repeating, defying explanation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE SIGNAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What should be humanity's greatest discovery becomes its most dangerous secret. As you decode the transmission, factions emerge from the shadows. Each wants control. Each offers protection, or threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your government demands classification. Foreign powers want access. Scientists want transparency. Corporate interests see profit. Conspiracy theorists want it destroyed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You're the only one who can hear it clearly. Your choices determine everything.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OPERATE THE STATION</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Align satellite dishes through analog controls</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Analyze waveforms on vintage oscilloscopes</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decode transmissions using period-accurate terminals</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair failing equipment under pressure</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage survival resources in isolation</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ONE ROOM. INFINITE CONSEQUENCES.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric tension. Moral decisions with lasting impact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decode an impossible signal using tactile 1980s analog equipment through puzzle-solving, pattern recognition, and resource management. Navigate competing faction demands through branching dialogue choices that determine humanity's response.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DISCOVER THE TRUTH!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007640/extras/bc604a4e41ceae73c6de6ba352a81fde.poster.avif?t=1769673384\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007640/extras/bc604a4e41ceae73c6de6ba352a81fde.webm?t=1769673384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007640/extras/bc604a4e41ceae73c6de6ba352a81fde.mp4?t=1769673384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You are Operator_07. Decode an impossible signal. Decide humanity's fate.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1984. Remote listening station. An anomalous pattern appears in the cosmic noise structured, repeating, defying explanation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE SIGNAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What should be humanity's greatest discovery becomes its most dangerous secret. As you decode the transmission, factions emerge from the shadows. Each wants control. Each offers protection, or threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your government demands classification. Foreign powers want access. Scientists want transparency. Corporate interests see profit. Conspiracy theorists want it destroyed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You're the only one who can hear it clearly. Your choices determine everything.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OPERATE THE STATION</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Align satellite dishes through analog controls</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Analyze waveforms on vintage oscilloscopes</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decode transmissions using period-accurate terminals</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair failing equipment under pressure</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage survival resources in isolation</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ONE ROOM. INFINITE CONSEQUENCES.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric tension. Moral decisions with lasting impact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decode an impossible signal using tactile 1980s analog equipment through puzzle-solving, pattern recognition, and resource management. Navigate competing faction demands through branching dialogue choices that determine humanity's response.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DISCOVER THE TRUTH!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Remote listening station. 1984. You're the operator decoding an impossible signal using oscilloscopes, tape machines, and analog equipment. Align satellites. Analyze waveforms. Make choices that determine humanity's response. Multiple endings. DISCOVER THE TRUTH!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Turkish, Ukrainian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "